			"widgets_values":[
				"integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Cinematic high-detail 3D Chinese fantasy action animation, 16:9, set on a vast brown desert under dense charcoal storm clouds with distant jagged mountains. Two adult warriors fight across the sand: a pale silver-haired male in layered black robes and dark armor with gold ornament, wielding a long dark polearm charged with violet lightning; and a pale icy-haired female in white robes and light silver armor, wielding a translucent cyan ice sword. At 00:00.000, the male rushes from the left foreground toward the female in the distance, cloak and hair streaming backward. From 00:00.300 to 00:00.650, he lowers into an attack posture and closes the distance fast. Around 00:00.700, he triggers a burst of violet electrical energy: thick purple lightning branches erupt around him and illuminate the sand. The female answers with cyan energy, and from 00:00.850 to 00:01.100 blue-white ice pillars spear upward while violet explosions detonate between them, throwing dust into the air. From 00:01.100 to 00:02.100, the camera rises into a steep overhead orbit, showing both fighters moving between repeated impact zones marked by purple-white blasts, tall cyan ice eruptions, and dark dust scars. From 00:02.100 to 00:02.500, the camera dives behind the female as she swings her cyan sword horizontally, producing a long bright blue energy arc. The male leaps ahead of her, silhouetted against the storm sky. From 00:02.500 to 00:03.300, more ice eruptions and violet detonations burst between them while the female drives her attack forward. Around 00:02.900, a particularly bright violet-white explosion blooms near center frame. From 00:03.300 to 00:03.650, a huge mixed blue-white and violet detonation fills the frame with dust, bloom and motion blur. By 00:03.700, the black-robed male regains momentum and sprints low across the desert toward the right, threading past standing ice formations. From 00:03.700 to 00:05.133, the camera follows him as purple energy gathers along the end of his polearm into a bright elongated blade-like glow while dust trails form beneath his feet.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:05.167, hard cut to a close frontal three-quarter view of the white-robed female warrior. Her expression is calm and severe; blue-white crystalline explosions glow behind her. She extends one hand forward and draws the cyan sword across her body. From 00:05.200 to 00:05.500, cold blue energy thickens along the blade. From 00:05.500 to 00:05.700, she thrusts and sweeps outward, launching a broad cyan-white wave of ice energy toward screen-right. The wave expands rapidly, resembling flowing frost and translucent crystalline feathers, while purple and blue impacts erupt along its path. From 00:05.700 to 00:06.300, the camera pulls wide as the black-robed male races alongside or away from the spreading ice attack, his polearm trailing violet light, while extremely tall ice pillars explode upward from the desert floor. From 00:06.300 to 00:07.200, the male counterattacks by dashing horizontally with a bright violet blade-like energy projection sweeping just above the sand. The female advances in the opposite direction with cyan energy streaming from her sword. Around 00:07.200, the attacks intersect at close range, producing a purple flash followed by an enormous blue-white ice explosion. From 00:07.300 to 00:07.700, fractured translucent ice and turbulent frost fill the entire frame. From 00:07.700 to 00:08.300, the camera emerges and reveals both fighters again at close distance, the female gliding forward with her sword extended and a long cyan trail behind her, while the male braces with his violet-charged polearm. From 00:08.300 to 00:08.900, the duel shifts into close-quarters combat as the female lunges directly at him and he rotates his torso, raising the polearm diagonally to intercept. Cyan and violet reflections wash over their faces and hair. From 00:08.900 to 00:09.300, the female rises higher in front of him with her cyan sword extended while he tracks her from below. The camera rises into a top-down perspective. From 00:09.300 to 00:10.000, both fighters break apart and accelerate along opposing diagonal paths, leaving vivid violet and cyan trails that cross into a large X carved through the dust. Around 00:09.500, a concentrated violet-white impact flashes at the crossing point. From 00:10.000 to 00:10.400, the camera dives down again as they converge near jagged rocks and isolated ice pillars. From 00:10.400 to 00:11.100, they exchange several fast close-range attacks: the male swings the long staff-like weapon horizontally and diagonally while the female slips past and counters with the cyan blade. Around 00:11.000, purple and cyan energy meet directly between the weapons in a compact spark burst. From 00:11.100 to 00:11.700, the female keeps advancing while the male rotates back and raises the polearm overhead, where purple electricity gathers into a bright concentrated flare. From 00:11.700 to 00:12.000, the female releases another broad cyan ground-level sweep, sending a thin luminous sheet of frost racing across the sand as the male retreats toward screen-right.\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:12.033, hard cut to the black-robed silver-haired male suspended alone high above the dark cloud layer, upright in the stormy sky with his long polearm beside him. A concentrated violet glow surrounds his head and upper body. The camera slowly pulls back, making him appear smaller against the massive cloud field. From 00:12.300 to 00:12.800, a small circular violet-white energy source forms above him in the clouds and the surrounding cloud mass begins rotating inward into a vortex. From 00:12.800 to 00:13.200, the vortex expands rapidly into a broad circular opening with an intense white-violet center and a dark-purple ring. The suspended warrior remains aligned directly beneath the center. Around 00:13.200, the first major lightning branches burst outward. From 00:13.200 to 00:13.700, dozens of thick violet-white lightning bolts propagate radially through the underside of the storm cloud, repeatedly branching while the sky flashes purple. From 00:13.700 to 00:14.500, the electrical storm reaches maximum scale: the giant circular vortex dominates the upper frame with a brilliant white-violet core and long branching lightning veins extending outward in every direction. The camera continues a subtle pullback, emphasizing the enormous scale difference between the floating warrior and the supernatural storm. In the final frame, he remains suspended directly below the vortex while multiple violet lightning branches stay fully extended and actively glowing as the video cuts off.\n\noverall_soundscape: Continuous high-intensity fantasy battle sound design with strong wind, rushing movement, cloth and weapon whooshes, electrical crackling, magical energy surges, explosive sand impacts and sharp crystalline ice eruptions. Large elemental collisions produce deep impact booms, while the final sky sequence is dominated by sustained thunder-like energy and branching lightning crackle. No clear spoken dialogue is present.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: Continuous dramatic fantasy-action score with dark orchestral and synthetic textures, strong low-frequency pulses and steadily escalating rhythmic intensity. The music drives the duel forward and expands into an ominous climax during the final airborne lightning-vortex sequence, continuing through the last frame.",
